   "date": "2019-04-05T11:52:22Z",
   "subject": "Shape visualization of 3D shape changes along an independent variable",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Hi everybody,<br></font><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">I am trying to visualize 3D shape changes (3D <span style=\"color:rgb(58,58,58)\">deformation grids</span>) along an independent  variable (the equivalent of tpsregr and 2D data).</font></div><div>I would appreciate for any ideas that could help in this direction.</div><div>Thanks in advance</div><div>Best</div><div>Natasa</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "YhBjrUN8CAAJ",
   "from": "Adams, Dean [EEOBS]",
   "author": "4d71c6e24fb21497",
   "date": "2019-04-05T15:59:56Z",
   "subject": "RE: [geomorph-r-package] Shape visualization of 3D shape changes along an independent variable",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Natasa,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">There are several options. First, ProcD.lm will generate fitted values for specimens from the regression 9see help file). One can convert those to a 3D array\r\n and plot each versus the overall mean found from mshape.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">For this one can use plotRefToTarget. It can do so via points, or 2 sets of 2D TPS deformation grids.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAgain, the help file for that function provides details and an example. <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><br>\r\nDean<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dr. Dean C. Adams<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Director of Graduate Education, EEB Program<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Professor<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Iowa State University<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><a href=\"https://www.eeob.iastate.edu/faculty/adams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eeob.iastate.edu/faculty/adams/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485009168000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3gPTmXyhRT2QKjH5iTjZLQ\">https://www.eeob.iastate.edu/faculty/adams/</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">phone: <a href=\"tel:(515)%20294-3834\" value=\"+15152943834\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">515-294-3834</a><u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
    ],
