     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Natasa Dimitriadi<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, April 5, 2019 6:52 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> geomorph R package &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [geomorph-r-package] Shape visualization of 3D shape changes along an independent variable<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Hi everybody,</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">I am trying to visualize 3D shape changes (3D <span style=\"color:#3a3a3a\">deformation grids</span>) along an independent  variable (the equivalent of tpsregr and 2D data).</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I would appreciate for any ideas that could help in this direction.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks in advance<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Best<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Natasa<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>"
