    [
     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear Dean, <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you for your answer. My basic problem is on visualizing the shape differences along the CV axes. As my data is 3D, I need to visualize shape differences through a mesh3d object (as in plottangent.Space where a mesh3d object is to\r\n be warped to represent shape deformation along X-axis). Do you have any idea on how I can do that for the CVA analysis?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you in advance, <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt\">Natasa<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>"
