     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">Hello again!</font><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">Till now, to visualize a shape change from score -5 to +5 along the CV1 axis I performed the following  functions: <br></font></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(235,244,247);color:rgb(115,129,145);white-space:pre\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></span></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(235,244,247)\">cvvis5 &lt;- </span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre\">5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(235,244,247)\">*matrix(cvall$CVvis[,</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(235,244,247)\">],nrow(cvall$Grandm),ncol(cvall$Grandm))+cvall$Grandm\r\ncvvisNeg5 &lt;- -</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre\">5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(235,244,247)\">*matrix(cvall$CVvis[,</span><span style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(235,244,247)\">],nrow(cvall$Grandm),ncol(cvall$Grandm))+cvall$Grandm</span><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">I converted cvvis5 and cvvisNeg5 into matrixes and performed warpRefMesh function where mesh= from <span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125)\">‘findMeanSpec’  an<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">d ref= </span></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre\">cvvis5  or </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre\">cvvisNeg5. </span></span></font></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:rgb(0,25,58);background-color:rgb(235,244,247)\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:rgb(0,25,58);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">warpRefMesh(scan130 scan130_alllandmarks2d,cvvis5)</font></span></div><div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:rgb(0,25,58)\">warpRefMesh(scan130 scan130_alllandmarks2d,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre\">cvvisNeg5</span><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:rgb(0,25,58)\">)</span></font></div></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre;color:rgb(0,25,58);background-color:rgb(235,244,247)\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">For each of the refs, a warping mesh will appear demonstrating either the mesh of score -5 or score +5.</font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">The differences I get on the meshes are also explained by previous data. Do you find this method trustworthy?</font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">Thanks again in advance for your time, </font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">Natasa</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(235,244,247);color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(235,244,247);color:rgb(0,25,58);white-space:pre\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(235,244,247);color:rgb(0,25,58);font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><br></span></div></div>"
    ]
